        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> be </STYLE> in his <gr str="1004">house</gr>: and his <gr str="6666">righteousness </gr>
        <gr str="5975">endureth </gr>
        <gr str="5703">forever</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="4"> Unto the <gr str="3477">upright </gr>there <gr str="2224">ariseth </gr>
        <gr str="216">light </gr>in the <gr str="2822">darkness</gr>: <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> he </STYLE>
        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> is </STYLE>
        <gr str="2587">gracious</gr>, and full of <gr str="7349">compassion</gr>, and <gr str="6662">righteous</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="5"> A <gr str="2896">good </gr>
        <gr str="376">man </gr>showeth <gr str="2603">favor</gr>, and <gr str="3867">lendeth</gr>: he will <gr str="3557">guide </gr>his <gr str="1697">affairs </gr>with <gr str="4941">discretion</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="6">
        <gr str="3588">Surely </gr>he shall <gr str="3808">not </gr>be <gr str="4131">moved </gr>
