        <gr str="2143">remembrance</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="7"> He shall <gr str="3808">not </gr>be <gr str="3372">afraid </gr>of <gr str="7451">evil </gr>
        <gr str="4480 8052">tidings</gr>: his <gr str="3820">heart </gr>is <gr str="3559">fixed</gr>, <gr str="982">trusting </gr>in the <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="8"> His <gr str="3820">heart </gr>
        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> is </STYLE>
