        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> desire </STYLE> upon his <gr str="6862">enemies</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="9"> He hath <gr str="6340">dispersed</gr>, he hath <gr str="5414">given </gr>to the <gr str="34">poor</gr>; his <gr str="6666">righteousness </gr>
        <gr str="5975">endureth </gr>
        <gr str="5703">forever</gr>; his <gr str="7161">horn </gr>shall be <gr str="7311">exalted </gr>with <gr str="3519">honor</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="10"> The <gr str="7563">wicked </gr>shall <gr str="7200">see </gr>
